\newlabel{fig:ch4_Beam-pair_local_relay}{{6}{8}{Illustration of Beam-Pair Local Relay (BPLR). Candidate critical users in closed beams are reassociated to the corresponding helper relay beams according to $\mathcal {M}_{\mathrm {off}\to \mathrm {relay}}(t)$}{figure.6}{}}
